{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32412","headline":"牡丹二首 二 · 温庭筠","name":"牡丹二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水漾晴红压叠波，晓来金粉覆庭莎。\n裁成艳思偏应巧，分得春光最数多。\n欲绽似含双靥笑，正繁疑有一声歌。\n华堂客散帘垂地，想凭阑干歛翠蛾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}